    "closure": "exact adjugate and Cauchy-Binet factorization",
    "statement": "The marked square Hankel pencil L(t)=H_1(t)-x_0H_0(t) has generic rank rho and adjugate D(t)q(t)q(t)^T. Its scalar factors exactly as D=c Delta(t)Q(t;x_0), where Delta is the degree-(m-1) regular Kronecker determinant and Q(t;x_0)=A_0(t)S(t) has degree m. Factoring L through the marked Vandermonde support gives an exact Cauchy-Binet formula for every cofactor as a sum over rho-subsets. At least 2m+3 of the 4m+1 supported slopes avoid D and specialize the ledger to a nonzero rank-one outer square of a squarefree D-split locator.",
